The grammar is compressed and difficult: rest (line 109) is governed by we (lines 98, 101);
Which in line 110 refers back to the shapes too bright to see (line 108); Asia presumably realises, as these
shapes become visible to her, that they resemble Prometheus himself (somewhat like thee).
